' 10/14/2026: lightbar Trc right (Time: Reset Clock) re-reads the clock with
' sub.clocks im=10, whatever the method saved in e.data record 37 (CMD device,
' DS12C887, Ultimate, TeensyROM, Lt. Kernal), and quietly; nothing for manual.
' It replaced CMD-only code (4500-4528), which skipped every other method.
' sub.clocks takes sub.modem's place at 60000; the idle loop loads it again
4500 &,52,25,.:b$="update time":x=11:gosub 3080:close 2:im=10:a$="clocks":gosub 74:return
